      "note_json": "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"color: #ff8c42\\\">PIMPMYPONY TXT2IMG \u2014 WILDCARDS + FACE DETAILER</h1>\\n<p>PonyXL / Illustrious Text-to-Image with TagForge wildcards and built-in <b>Easy-Use Face Detailer</b> (no Impact Pack needed).</p>\\n\\n<h2>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Civitai Model</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2628215\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Real Anime</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2611135\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - InCase Style</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=1346446\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Semi Real Anime</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The workflow ships with <code>ilustmix_v111.safetensors</code> \u2014 any Pony/Illustrious XL checkpoint works.</p>\\n<hr>\\n\\n<h2>\ud83d\ude0a FACE DETAILER (Easy-Use \u2014 no Impact Pack)</h2>\\n<p>Runs on <code>UltralyticsDetector \u2192 PreDetailerFix \u2192 DetailerFix</code> from <b>ComfyUI-Easy-Use</b>.</p>\\n<p><b>Required detector models:</b></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>face_yolov8m.pt</code> \u2192 <code>ComfyUI/models/ultralytics/bbox/</code><br>\\n<a href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Bingsu/adetailer/resolve/main/face_yolov8m.pt\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\ud83d\udd17 download</a></li>\\n<li><code>sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth</code> \u2192 <code>ComfyUI/models/sams/</code><br>\\n<a href=\\\"https://dl.fbaipublicfiles.com/segment_anything/sam_vit_b_01ec64.pth\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">\ud83d\udd17 download</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n<hr>\\n\\n<h2>\ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f AutoTag Node with Wildcards included</h2>\\n<p>Install it from ComfyUI Manager or clone the repo:</p>\\n<pre>cd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\\ngit clone https://github.com/huchukato/ComfyUI-TagForge.git</pre>\\n\\n<p>\u2728 <b>Wildcard Sub-Selection</b> (a1111-sd-webui-tagcomplete style):</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Type <code>__</code> to see available wildcards</li>\\n<li>Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter \u2192 inserts <code>__wildcard_name__</code></li>\\n<li>Auto-show options \u2192 immediately displays all options from that wildcard</li>\\n<li>Select an option and press Enter \u2192 replaces wildcard with chosen option</li>\\n<li>ESC \u2192 keeps inserted wildcard and closes options</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>\ud83c\udf1f <b>Features</b></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Smart parsing: wildcards with complex paths (e.g. <code>__pmp/blwjob/blwjb__</code>)</li>\\n<li>Line-by-line options: each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option</li>\\n<li>Text overflow handling: long options truncated with hover expansion</li>\\n<li>Full compatibility with existing wildcard files and formats</li>\\n<li>Multiple sources: repository, ComfyUI/models and DynamicPrompts</li>\\n</ul>\\n\\n<p>\ud83d\udcc1 <b>Wildcard Sources</b> (in priority order):</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Repository wildcards/ folder</li>\\n<li>ComfyUI models/wildcards/</li>\\n<li>ComfyUI custom_nodes/wildcards/</li>\\n<li>DynamicPrompts wildcards/</li>\\n<li>Extra model paths configuration</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p><i>This extension is based on ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts.</i></p>\\n<hr>\\n\\n<h2>\ud83d\udcc1 Manual Wildcard Setup (Optional)</h2>\\n<p>To use wildcards with Easy-Use you may need to copy the wildcards folder:</p>\\n<pre>cp -r /path/to/ComfyUI-TagForge/wildcards \\\\\\n    /path/to/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Easy-Use/wildcards/</pre>\\n<p>Then <b>restart ComfyUI</b> to load the new wildcards.</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":517.0199082421873,\"height\":814.8184835546876}"
